# Only send the API, its workspace packages and workspace manifests to the builder.
*
!Dockerfile
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!apps/
!apps/api/
!apps/api/**
!packages/
!packages/api-contract/
!packages/api-contract/**

# Local dependencies, build output and secrets must never enter an image.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.env*
**/*.log
**/*.tsbuildinfo
apps/api/audit
